      "title": "A Father’s Four Sons",
      "description": "Marmee recounts meeting the father who freely gave four sons to the war and feeling ashamed of her own fear. Jo listens to Mother’s account, then asks for another real story with a moral. Meg hears the cost borne by the old soldier’s father while the sewing circle grows sober.",
